{"4339260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Under the Eye", "steam_appid": 4339260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4339260/extras/60e16982d6bc5f64f9581a2475b60df7.poster.avif?t=1787743608\" width=616 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4339260/extras/60e16982d6bc5f64f9581a2475b60df7.webm?t=1787743608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4339260/extras/60e16982d6bc5f64f9581a2475b60df7.mp4?t=1787743608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Under The Eye,</strong> you play cards against a ruthless Major of the state police,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >all while being interrogated about the resistance you're part of. Being caught in</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a lie will result in immediate personal consequences, but telling the truth will hurt</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >your cause and the people fighting for it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage the <strong>Major</strong>'s patience and the strength</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >of the resistance while fighting to win as many rounds of the game as possible. Abandon your</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >morals to save your skin or risk your life to secure the future of the next generations to come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a mainly <strong>narrative experience</strong> and will <strong>feature multiple endings</strong>,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >all depending on your choices during the interrogation and your skill at the table.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The  game will take place over the course of 5-7 days, where you will shape the outcome</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >of the conflict. You will be able to witness the state of the world around you through cutscenes, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >newspapers, documents, dialogue with the Major and details scattered around the room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4339260/extras/60e16982d6bc5f64f9581a2475b60df7.poster.avif?t=1787743608\" width=616 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4339260/extras/60e16982d6bc5f64f9581a2475b60df7.webm?t=1787743608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4339260/extras/60e16982d6bc5f64f9581a2475b60df7.mp4?t=1787743608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Under The Eye,</strong> you play cards against a ruthless Major of the state police,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >all while being interrogated about the resistance you're part of. Being caught in</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a lie will result in immediate personal consequences, but telling the truth will hurt</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >your cause and the people fighting for it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage the <strong>Major</strong>'s patience and the strength</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >of the resistance while fighting to win as many rounds of the game as possible. Abandon your</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >morals to save your skin or risk your life to secure the future of the next generations to come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a mainly <strong>narrative experience</strong> and will <strong>feature multiple endings</strong>,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >all depending on your choices during the interrogation and your skill at the table.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The  game will take place over the course of 5-7 days, where you will shape the outcome</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >of the conflict. You will be able to witness the state of the world around you through cutscenes, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >newspapers, documents, dialogue with the Major and details scattered around the room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "You are a prisoner. The Major wants names from the resistance and she is willing to play cards for them. Win a hand and your next lie holds up better. Get caught three times and she kills you. You can always save yourself with the truth, but every name you give her buys another execution.", "supported_languages": "English, Romanian, Russian, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4339260/36cd6877b3d523b1bf79a72503819a7d154fcb3d/header.jpg?t=1787743608", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4339260/0a05396f57361af8b6e688c02a37a2120486ac65/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787743608", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4339260/0a05396f57361af8b6e688c02a37a2120486ac65/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787743608", "website": "https://storknestgames.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-2100 / AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 4000 / NVIDIA GeF